      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That dissociation between the effort of seeking meaning and the crushing weight of the void is a very difficult place to be in, and your skepticism about any forced \"solution\" adds a layer of isolation to your pain. Please remember that while the feeling of falling into nothingness is overwhelming and terrifying, it does not mean that reality is actually empty or that a sudden end to all possibility has begun. You might be curious about exploring this specific feeling in a safe space with a professional who can help you process what's happening without trying to \"fix\" the philosophy of it immediately.",
